	(text "RADIO MEZZANINE J14 - 2x10\n\n   1  +3V3_PB         2  +3V3_PB\n   3  GND             4  +3V3_PB\n   5  ESP_SPI_SCK     6  GND\n   7  GND             8  ESP_HANDSHAKE\n   9  ESP_SPI_MOSI   10  GND\n  11  GND            12  ESP_DATA_READY\n  13  ESP_SPI_MISO   14  GND\n  15  GND            16  ESP_RST\n  17  ESP_SPI_CS     18  GND\n  19  GND            20  GND\n\nEvery signal has GND beside it and across from it.\nPowered from +3V3_PB (powerboard only): the radio is off on USB,\nkeeping USB current low. With no powerboard, firmware holds the\nradio pins low or Hi-Z.\nSPI3 mode 3, 3 Mbit/s, hardware CRC off, 8-bit (V0.3 differs: M4).\nDaughterboard: match this pinout, pull EN up, diode-OR its USB 3V3,\nkeep HANDSHAKE and DATA_READY off strapping pins (m1).\nNeeds a latching connector (M6). DESIGN_NOTES.md §11."
		(at 151.13 302.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0bb513a9-aa27-4b19-b45f-90de2fcb0e0e")
	)
