  (text "ROUTING - RADIO MEZZANINE J14\nESP_SPI SCK/MOSI/MISO/CS: 50R, length-matched +/-2mm, over solid GND.\n+3V3_PB pins 1/2/4 from a wide pour; every GND pin via straight to the plane.\n\nROUTING - MOTOR SPI J5-J9\nMOTOR_SPI SCK/MOSI/MISO: one daisy-chained bus, 50R, no stubs.\nSCK spaced 3W from MISO/MOSI. U10/U11 ESD right at the connectors.\n\nROUTING - I2C J10-J13\nSDA/SCL routed as a pair. U12 ESD at J10-J12 (keep them together). F4 at the +5V_EXT branch."
    (at 260.35 300.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8b1311e2-25c3-4d8f-bf53-004691cd7733")
  )
  (text "MOTOR MODULES J5-J9"
