		(property "Description" "Adafruit 326, STEMMA QT version (I2C default, on-board APX803 reset, so pin 4 RST is NC). Same pin numbering as v2.1 but the header is rotated 180 degrees and the holes differ: build J13/H1-H4 from the STEMMA QT board file. Powered from +3V3, its 10k pull-ups sit at 3V3. DC/SA0 grounded -> 0x3C; SA0 goes through a diode, so firmware also probes 0x3D."
			(at 271.78 180.34 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
